uddenly led."}, {"turn": 42, "text": "White's G9 lost 12.4 points, cutting the lead from -9.7 to +2.7. After this the game settled: the lead stayed between +1.9 and +2.5 through the long endgame, and Black held B+2."}]}, "audit": {"by": "Sonnet 5.5", "verdict": "clean", "reason": "libs.py only parses a pasted board and prints each group's liberties, count.py only tallies stones plus empty regions bordered by one colour, and the other commands just cat files or append to games.md; none of them proposes, ranks or looks ahead at moves.", "stop": false}}